1
00:00:00,358 --> 00:00:02,898
- Are you sure?
- Look, I grew up on a farm, okay?

2
00:00:03,069 --> 00:00:06,989
(Penny:)From what I heard, they're either having sex
or Howard's caught in a milking machine.

3
00:00:09,784 --> 00:00:11,494
(Penny:)Do you mind if I stay here tonight?

4
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:14,870
No. Yeah, take the couch, or my bed.
I just got new pillows.

5
00:00:15,039 --> 00:00:17,289
(Leonard:)Hypoallergenic.

6
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:19,163
(Penny:)Uh, the couch is good.

7
00:00:19,335 --> 00:00:21,625
(Sheldon:)Hold that thought. Leonard, a moment.

8
00:00:25,716 --> 00:00:27,176
(Leonard:)You have a problem with this.

9
00:00:27,343 --> 00:00:28,383
(Sheldon:)Where do I begin?

10
00:00:28,552 --> 00:00:31,392
(Leonard:)It's up to you. Crazy person's choice.

11
00:00:31,555 --> 00:00:33,895
(Sheldon:)Well, first, we don't have house guests.

12
00:00:34,058 --> 00:00:37,098
(Sheldon:)Frankly, if I could afford the rent,
I'd ask you to leave.

13
00:00:37,853 --> 00:00:40,523
(Leonard:)Your friendship means a lot
to me as well. What else?

14
00:00:41,107 --> 00:00:43,357
(Sheldon:)Well, our earthquake supplies.

15
00:00:43,526 --> 00:00:45,946
- We have a two-man, two-day kit.
- So?

16
00:00:46,112 --> 00:00:49,362
So if there's an earthquake
and the three of us are trapped here...

17
00:00:49,532 --> 00:00:52,532
(Sheldon:)...we could be out of food
by tomorrow afternoon.

18
00:00:53,285 --> 00:00:55,415
(Leonard:)Are you suggesting
that if we let Penny stay...

19
00:00:55,579 --> 00:00:57,709
(Leonard:)...we might succumb to cannibalism?

